# =====================================================================
# FastFusion-IF .gitignore
# Goal: commit ONLY source code + small reproducibility files.
# Everything large or regenerable (caches, checkpoints, eval dumps,
# datasets, ESM weights) stays OUT of the repository.
#
# NOTE ON THE LEADING SLASHES
# A pattern like `data/` matches a directory named `data` at ANY depth,
# which silently swallowed `fastfusion_if/data/` (the entire data-loading
# subpackage) in an earlier version of this file. A leading slash anchors
# the pattern to the repository root, which is what we actually want for
# every entry below. Do not remove the slashes.
# =====================================================================

# ---- generated training / evaluation artifacts (large) ----
/runs/
/eval/
/cache/
/final_results/
/final_results_backup/
/crash_logs/
/code_backups/

# ---- raw datasets & downloads (users fetch these themselves; see README) ----
/data/
/AGAT-PPIS/
*.tar.gz
*.tar
*.zip

# ---- model weights / checkpoints ----
# Training outputs are excluded, but the small RELEASED checkpoints in
# checkpoints/ are committed on purpose (~5 MB each) so users can run
# inference straight from a clone. The negation below must come AFTER the
# *.pt rule to take effect.
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
!checkpoints/*.pt

# ---- mmseqs working dirs and baked feature arrays (regenerable) ----
*.work/
manifests/**/_plm/
*.npz
*.npy

# ---- python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
/build/
/dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---- OS / editor ----
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: the manifests/*.csv files (train/val/test split membership) and
# the small *.report.json / *.cluster_report.json files ARE committed on
# purpose — they define the exact splits used in the paper. They
# currently contain absolute paths of the form
# /home/<user>/Nima/AGAT-PPIS/Dataset/pdb/xxxx.pdb, which leaks your
# username and directory layout. Consider regenerating them with
# basenames before making the repository public. To exclude them
# instead, uncomment:
# manifests/*.csv
/figures/

# Generated analysis results
/results/
